      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1353061584,
      "text": "Eugenia myrcianthes or ubajay is a species of plant in the family Myrtaceae found in Argentina, Bolivia, Brazil, Paraguay and Uruguay."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Eugenia myrcianthes",
